#. type: Plain text
#: src/guides/sdk-auth/en.mdx:9
#, no-wrap
msgid "## Password Authentication\n"
msgstr "<Heading level={2} id=\"password-authentication\">パスワード認証</Heading>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/guides/sdk-auth/en.mdx:11
#, no-wrap
msgid "If you are using password auth, you should generate an [app password](/specs/xrpc#app-passwords) for your account rather than using your main account password. If you are using Bluesky, you can generate an app password in your [account settings](https://bsky.app/settings/app-passwords).\n"
msgstr "パスワード認証を使用している場合は、メインのアカウントパスワードではなく[アプリパスワード](/specs/xrpc#app-passwords)を生成するべきです。Blueskyを使用している場合は、[アカウント設定](https://bsky.app/settings/app-passwords)でアプリパスワードを生成できます。\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/guides/sdk-auth/en.mdx:20
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<TabGroup defaultValue=\"ts\">\n"
"  <TabList>\n"
"    <Tab value=\"ts\">TypeScript</Tab>\n"
"    <Tab value=\"go\">Go</Tab>\n"
"  </TabList>\n"
"  <TabPanels>\n"
"    <TabPanel value=\"ts\">\n"
"    Start by importing `PasswordSession`, providing credentials to `PasswordSession.login()`, and creating a `session`:\n"
msgstr ""
"<TabGroup defaultValue=\"ts\">\n"
"  <TabList>\n"
"    <Tab value=\"ts\">TypeScript</Tab>\n"
"    <Tab value=\"go\">Go</Tab>\n"
"  </TabList>\n"
"  <TabPanels>\n"
"    <TabPanel value=\"ts\">\n"
"    まずは`PasswordSession`をインポートし、`PasswordSession.login()`に資格情報を与えて`session`を生成します。\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/guides/sdk-auth/en.mdx:23
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    ```tsx\n"
"    import { PasswordSession } from '@atproto/lex-password-session'\n"
msgstr ""
"    ```tsx\n"
"    import { PasswordSession } from '@atproto/lex-password-session'\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/guides/sdk-auth/en.mdx:29
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    const result = await PasswordSession.login({\n"
"      service: 'https://bsky.social', // or your PDS host\n"
"      identifier: 'your-handle.bsky.social',\n"
"      password: 'your-app-password',\n"
"    })\n"
msgstr ""
"    const result = await PasswordSession.login({\n"
"      service: 'https://bsky.social', // or your PDS host\n"
"      identifier: 'your-handle.bsky.social',\n"
"      password: 'your-app-password',\n"
"    })\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/guides/sdk-auth/en.mdx:34
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    if (result.success) {\n"
"        const session = result.value\n"
"    }\n"
"    ```\n"
msgstr ""
"    if (result.success) {\n"
"        const session = result.value\n"
"    }\n"
"    ```\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/guides/sdk-auth/en.mdx:36
#, no-wrap
msgid "    Applications with an end user login flow should use [OAuth](/guides/oauth-cli-tutorial) authentication rather than app password sessions. Password auth is acceptable for bots and command line tools.\n"
msgstr "    エンドユーザーログインフローを備えるアプリケーションは、アプリパスワードセッションではなく[OAuth](/guides/oauth-cli-tutorial)認証を使用しましょう。パスワード認証はボットやコマンドラインツールに適しています。\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/guides/sdk-auth/en.mdx:41
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    Both methods will produce the same authenticated `session`.\n"
"    </TabPanel>\n"
"    <TabPanel value=\"go\">\n"
"    Start by importing the `atproto` and `xrpc` libraries, creating an `&xrpc.Client{}`, and providing credentials to call `ServerCreateSession()`:\n"
msgstr ""
"    どちらの方法でも同じ認証済み`session`が生成されます。\n"
"    </TabPanel>\n"
"    <TabPanel value=\"go\">\n"
"    まずは`atproto`と`xrpc`ライブラリをインポートし、`&xrpc.Client{}`を作って`ServerCreateSession()`に資格情報を与えます。\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/guides/sdk-auth/en.mdx:48
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    ```go\n"
"    import (\n"
"      \"context\"\n"
"      comatproto \"github.com/bluesky-social/indigo/api/atproto\"\n"
"      \"github.com/bluesky-social/indigo/xrpc\"\n"
"    )\n"
msgstr ""
"    ```go\n"
"    import (\n"
"      \"context\"\n"
"      comatproto \"github.com/bluesky-social/indigo/api/atproto\"\n"
"      \"github.com/bluesky-social/indigo/xrpc\"\n"
"    )\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/guides/sdk-auth/en.mdx:51
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    func main() {\n"
"      ctx := context.Background()\n"
msgstr ""
"    func main() {\n"
"      ctx := context.Background()\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/guides/sdk-auth/en.mdx:55
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"      client := &xrpc.Client{\n"
"        Host: \"https://bsky.social\", // or your PDS host\n"
"      }\n"
msgstr ""
"      client := &xrpc.Client{\n"
"        Host: \"https://bsky.social\", // or your PDS host\n"
"      }\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/guides/sdk-auth/en.mdx:62
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"      session, _ := comatproto.ServerCreateSession(ctx, client, &comatproto.ServerCreateSession_Input{\n"
"        Identifier: \"your-handle.bsky.social\",\n"
"        Password:   \"your-app-password\",\n"
"      })\n"
"    }\n"
"    ```\n"
msgstr ""
"      session, _ := comatproto.ServerCreateSession(ctx, client, &comatproto.ServerCreateSession_Input{\n"
"        Identifier: \"your-handle.bsky.social\",\n"
"        Password:   \"your-app-password\",\n"
"      })\n"
"    }\n"
"    ```\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/guides/sdk-auth/en.mdx:67
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    Applications with an end user login flow should use [OAuth](/guides/go-oauth-cli-tutorial) authentication rather than app password sessions. Password auth is acceptable for bots and command line tools.\n"
"    </TabPanel>\n"
"  </TabPanels>\n"
"</TabGroup>\n"
msgstr ""
"    エンドユーザーログインフローを備えるアプリケーションは、アプリパスワードセッションではなく[OAuth](/guides/go-oauth-cli-tutorial)認証を使用しましょう。パスワード認証はボットやコマンドラインツールに適しています。\n"
"    </TabPanel>\n"
"  </TabPanels>\n"
"</TabGroup>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/guides/sdk-auth/en.mdx:69
#, no-wrap
msgid "## Client Sessions\n"
msgstr "<Heading level={2} id=\"client-sessions\">クライアントセッション</Heading>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/guides/sdk-auth/en.mdx:78
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<TabGroup defaultValue=\"ts\">\n"
"  <TabList>\n"
"    <Tab value=\"ts\">TypeScript</Tab>\n"
"    <Tab value=\"go\">Go</Tab>\n"
"  </TabList>\n"
"  <TabPanels>\n"
"    <TabPanel value=\"ts\">\n"
"    Once you have a logged-in `session`, you can create a `Client` instance to read and write data:\n"
msgstr ""
"<TabGroup defaultValue=\"ts\">\n"
"  <TabList>\n"
"    <Tab value=\"ts\">TypeScript</Tab>\n"
"    <Tab value=\"go\">Go</Tab>\n"
"  </TabList>\n"
"  <TabPanels>\n"
"    <TabPanel value=\"ts\">\n"
"    ログインした`session`が取得できたら、`Client`インスタンスを作成してデータの読み書きができます。\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/guides/sdk-auth/en.mdx:82
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    ```tsx\n"
"    import { Client } from '@atproto/lex'\n"
"    const client = new Client(session)\n"
msgstr ""
"    ```tsx\n"
"    import { Client } from '@atproto/lex'\n"
"    const client = new Client(session)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/guides/sdk-auth/en.mdx:89
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    // Make authenticated API calls\n"
"    console.log('Logged in as:', session.did)\n"
"    ```\n"
"    </TabPanel>\n"
"    <TabPanel value=\"go\">\n"
"    Once you have an authed `client`, you can store auth info and make API calls:\n"
msgstr ""
"    // 認証付きでAPIを呼び出す\n"
"    console.log('Logged in as:', session.did)\n"
"    ```\n"
"    </TabPanel>\n"
"    <TabPanel value=\"go\">\n"
"    ログインした`client`が取得できたら、認証情報を入力してAPIを呼び出します。\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/guides/sdk-auth/en.mdx:98
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    ```go\n"
"    // Store auth info on the client for subsequent requests\n"
"    client.Auth = &xrpc.AuthInfo{\n"
"      AccessJwt:  session.AccessJwt,\n"
"      RefreshJwt: session.RefreshJwt,\n"
"      Handle:     session.Handle,\n"
"      Did:        session.Did,\n"
"    }\n"
msgstr ""
"    ```go\n"
"    // 後続のリクエストのために認証情報をクライアントに保存します\n"
"    client.Auth = &xrpc.AuthInfo{\n"
"      AccessJwt:  session.AccessJwt,\n"
"      RefreshJwt: session.RefreshJwt,\n"
"      Handle:     session.Handle,\n"
"      Did:        session.Did,\n"
"    }\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/guides/sdk-auth/en.mdx:104
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    fmt.Printf(\"Logged in as: %s (%s)\\n\", session.Handle, session.Did)\n"
"    ```\n"
"    </TabPanel>\n"
"  </TabPanels>\n"
"</TabGroup>\n"
msgstr ""
"    fmt.Printf(\"Logged in as: %s (%s)\\n\", session.Handle, session.Did)\n"
"    ```\n"
"    </TabPanel>\n"
"  </TabPanels>\n"
"</TabGroup>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/guides/sdk-auth/en.mdx:106
#, no-wrap
msgid "From here, you can go directly to [making API requests](/guides/reads-and-writes).\n"
msgstr "ここから直接[APIリクエストの作成](/guides/reads-and-writes)に進めます。\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/guides/sdk-auth/en.mdx:108
#, no-wrap
msgid "## API Tokens\n"
msgstr "<Heading level={2} id=\"api-tokens\">APIトークン</Heading>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/guides/sdk-auth/en.mdx:110
#, no-wrap
msgid "Rate limits for logging in are generally lower than for other API operations. Calling the login method multiple times in a short period may trigger rate limits. You only need to call the login method once per session to authenticate.\n"
msgstr "ログインのレート制限は一般的に他のAPI操作よりも低く設定されています。短期間に何度もログインメソッドを呼び出すとレート制限が発動する可能性があります。認証するためにログイン用メソッドを呼ぶのはセッション毎に一度だけで十分です。\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/guides/sdk-auth/en.mdx:114
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The `com.atproto.server.createSession` API endpoint called by login methods returns a session object containing two API tokens:\n"
"* `accessJwt`: an access token which is used to authenticate requests but expires after a few minutes\n"
"* `refreshJwt`: a refresh token which lasts longer and is used only to update the session with a new access token\n"
msgstr ""
"ログインメソッドが呼ぶ`com.atproto.server.createSession` APIエンドポイントは、2つのAPIトークンを含むセッションオブジェクトを返します。\n"
"* `accessJwt`：数分で期限が切れる、リクエストを認証するために使用されるアクセストークン\n"
"* `refreshJwt`：期限が長く、アクセストークンを更新するためだけに使用されるリフレッシュトークン\n"

